<h2 id="irtdd-when" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">1. When this applies</h2>

| Trigger | Meaning |
|---------|---------|
| **`implreftdd`** | User attaches or names a refactor plan **`.md`**. Execute **implref** procedure with **TDD step 3** below. |
| **`resumimpltdd`** | Resume the same TDD-chain plan: first incomplete `[ ]`, same TDD rules. |
| **`aciubtdd`** active | **aciubtdd** delegates here for impl spine; do not fall back to plain **implref** mid-run. |

If the plan was authored with **`onlyreftdd`**, read its per-phase **TDD mode** labels before coding.

