<h2 id="irtdd-delegate" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">2. Classic delegate (required)</h2>

**Read and execute the full procedure** in:

**`.cursor/rules/implref-resumimpl-refactor-plan-followthrough.mdc`** (**`implref`** / **`resumimpl`**)

That covers: step 0 normalize, step 1 ambiguity gate, step 2 Quality bar in plan, step 3 phases, step 3.4 exwar, step 3.5 wip/completed, step 4 closing table, blockers (3.1d / 3.1e), and self-check.

**Non-TDD behavior lives only in the classic file.** Edit classic **`implref`** once when shared impl rules change; edit **this file** only when TDD execution rules change.

**Override:** [step 3 micro-loop](#irtdd-step3) and [heuristics](#irtdd-heuristics) **replace** any implicit code-first ordering from the classic chain.

