<h2 id="irtdd-heuristics" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">4. TDD mode heuristics (runtime)</h2>

Use the plan label when present. If missing, classify once at phase start:

<table>
<thead>
<tr style="background:#1565c0;color:white"><th>Signal</th><th>Mode</th></tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">New/changed API, manifest, emit, pool diff, merge/alias logic</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><strong>strict-TDD</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Delete files, routes, scopes, tabs, proto assets</td><td style="background:#fff8e1"><strong>smoke-after-delete</strong></td></tr>
<tr><td style="background:#e3f2fd">Ambiguous</td><td style="background:#e8f5e9"><strong>strict-TDD</strong> (note in plan Decision log)</td></tr>
</tbody>
</table>

