<h2 id="irtdd-mode-line" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">5. Plan TDD mode line (required)</h2>

At the **start of each phase**, emit one line (progress update or silent work header):

```text
TDD mode phase N: strict-TDD — test-first catalog_pool_mapping emit counts.
```

or

```text
TDD mode phase N: smoke-after-delete — remove E2B routes then run clitics e2e smoke.
```

Do not switch modes mid-phase without documenting in the plan Decision log.

