<h2 id="irtdd-self" style="color:#1565c0;font-size:1.22em;font-weight:650;border-left:4px solid #42a5f5;padding-left:10px;margin-top:1.1em">8. Self-check (agent)</h2>

- [ ] User invoked **`implreftdd`**, **`resumimpltdd`**, or **`aciubtdd`** with plan in scope.
- [ ] Full **`implref`** procedure followed except step 3 ordering.
- [ ] Each phase started with **TDD mode** one-liner.
- [ ] **`strict-TDD`:** red observed (or documented) before impl; green before `[X]`.
- [ ] Closing table per classic step 4 (tests run row mentions TDD mode used).
